{
	"metadata": {
		"version": "1.0-1.0",
		"frontmatter": {
			"id": "se.machine-tutorial",
			"kind": "machine",
			"statement": "The feature tour: every construct the machine language supports, in one compilable drawing.",
			"entry": "start",
			"reentry": "restart"
		}
	},
	"nodes": [
		{
			"id": "c-head",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "# The tutorial machine\nEvery feature the machine language supports, in one drawing. It compiles - the tests hold it green. Click any box to open its state note; double-click the portal to dive.",
			"x": -560,
			"y": -300,
			"width": 1000,
			"height": 150
		},
		{
			"id": "g-basics",
			"type": "group",
			"label": "basics",
			"x": -40,
			"y": -60,
			"width": 500,
			"height": 260
		},
		{
			"id": "n-start",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "spec/ledger/se/machine-tutorial-start.md",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 420,
			"height": 140
		},
		{
			"id": "c-state",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "A state = a file node onto a machine_state note. The note carries statement, guidance and the evidence form. Text boxes like this one are comments - the compiler skips them.",
			"x": 560,
			"y": -40,
			"width": 460,
			"height": 170
		},
		{
			"id": "n-try-build",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "spec/ledger/se/machine-tutorial-try-build.md",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 240,
			"width": 420,
			"height": 140,
			"styleAttributes": {
				"shape": "predefined-process"
			}
		},
		{
			"id": "c-engine",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "filled_by: engine - the engine runs the declared command itself; the result lands as pinned evidence with zero model turns. A failing command is a normal Failed.",
			"x": 560,
			"y": 220,
			"width": 460,
			"height": 170
		},
		{
			"id": "n-fix",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "spec/ledger/se/machine-tutorial-fix.md",
			"x": -560,
			"y": 240,
			"width": 420,
			"height": 140
		},
		{
			"id": "c-roles",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "Edge roles ride the edge popup (enable the se-machine-styles snippet). The label is the guard: try_build_attempts < 2 caps this loop - then the machine escapes to a human. Priority: authored > fallback > escape > ask-human.",
			"x": -560,
			"y": 440,
			"width": 460,
			"height": 210
		},
		{
			"id": "n-aborted",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "spec/ledger/se/machine-tutorial-aborted.md",
			"x": -560,
			"y": 720,
			"width": 420,
			"height": 140,
			"styleAttributes": {
				"shape": "terminal"
			}
		},
		{
			"id": "c-ends",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "Two ends: done (via the gate's approval) and aborted (the error role - infrastructure trouble, not test-red). Never drawn: escape-to-parent and ask-human exist on every state.",
			"x": -1080,
			"y": 700,
			"width": 460,
			"height": 190
		},
		{
			"id": "n-decide",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "spec/ledger/se/machine-tutorial-decide.md",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 520,
			"width": 420,
			"height": 140,
			"styleAttributes": {
				"shape": "diamond"
			}
		},
		{
			"id": "c-gate",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "A gate: submit creates an OFFER; a human blesses through their own channel (board, console, chat). The approval edge fires on the bless - mechanical states fill, never bless.",
			"x": 40,
			"y": 720,
			"width": 460,
			"height": 180
		},
		{
			"id": "n-sidetrack",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "spec/ledger/se/machine-tutorial-sidetrack.md",
			"x": 560,
			"y": 520,
			"width": 420,
			"height": 140
		},
		{
			"id": "c-socket",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "The socket: submachine: iteration lets the running iteration plug in its own one-shot drawing, kept in the iteration's folder as an event - never a template.",
			"x": 1080,
			"y": 500,
			"width": 460,
			"height": 180
		},
		{
			"id": "n-nested",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "spec/ledger/se/machine-systematic.canvas",
			"x": 560,
			"y": 780,
			"width": 420,
			"height": 300,
			"portal": true
		},
		{
			"id": "c-nest",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "Nesting: a file node onto another machine's canvas. Portal on shows it inline. The compiler links the machine, never copies it.",
			"x": 1080,
			"y": 800,
			"width": 460,
			"height": 160
		},
		{
			"id": "n-done",
			"type": "file",
